If enabled, display:
A dropdown selector for the Surah (populated from quranListProvider).
An Ayah number selector (populated dynamically up to surah.numberOfAyahs).
A beautiful preview container that fetches the Ayah text and shows it in Amiri font with gold borders.
A "Play/Stop Preview" button.
Modify the _save() function to write Quran fields into the model.
[MODIFY] 
reminder_dashboard_screen.dart
Enhance reminder list items:
Display a distinct icon for Quran reminders (e.g. Icons.menu_book or Icons.music_note).
